{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/y90nupkv","slideIndex":0,"text":"Source manuscript: 具有温度可视化功能的层状异质热致变色复合膜及其自适应热管理.docx, Abstract; Materials and Methods; Figures 3, 4(c,d), 9(a,e,f), 10(a,d), 12(c1,c2), 13(c-f); Conclusions. Style references: ITMC-fmt.pptx and 参考海报.png. One portrait page only, original size 30240288 × 42479913 EMU. Native text and layout remain editable. Experimental figures retain source measurements and axes; selected panels are cropped from originals and flattened onto white. The 200-cycle stability result refers to TC-RGY50. FPCM metrics refer to the storage layer. Outdoor cooling/warming values refer to bare copper under the reported strong-/weak-irradiance conditions, not ambient-temperature cooling. Authors, affiliation and contact were not supplied and remain editable placeholders."}